This repository is a monorepo containing four independent applications,
each under its own license. There is no single license that applies
to the repository as a whole — see the LICENSE file inside each app's
folder:

    apps/call/LICENSE   -> AGPL-3.0 (VCPeer Call, fork of MiroTalk P2P)
    apps/share/LICENSE  -> BSD-2-Clause (VCPeer Send, fork of Pingvin Share X)
    apps/book/LICENSE   -> MIT (VCPeer Book, fork of Cal.com / cal.diy)
    apps/live/LICENSE   -> MIT (VCPeer Live)

If you use, modify, or redistribute code from one of these apps, the
license that applies is the one in that app's own folder, not this
file. See README.md for details.
